==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[malarky]]
* [[mullarkey]]

===Etymology===
Of {{unk.|title=unknown}} origin. May be somebody's name.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/məˈlɑɹ.ki/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɑː(ɹ)ki}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# [[nonsense|Nonsense]]; [[rubbish]].
#: ''I decided it was a bunch of '''malarkey''' and stopped reading about halfway through.

